From: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
Subject: [PATCH] MIPS: ingenic: add the remaining T-series machines

Add machine types and generic device trees for T10, T21, T23, T30,
T32 and T33. The DTBs reuse the T31 peripheral description; the
per-SoC clock, pinctrl and timer drivers still have to follow.

Signed-off-by: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
---
--- a/arch/mips/ingenic/Kconfig
+++ b/arch/mips/ingenic/Kconfig
@@ -13,6 +13,12 @@
